# Line endings are part of the build here.
#
# The runtime build is a bash script that runs inside WSL, and a CRLF there fails with
# `$'\r': command not found` in a way that reads like a missing tool. Pin the shell and
# Python pieces to LF and leave everything else to the repository default.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
core/android-runtime/tools/* text eol=lf
